      "date": "2026-06-04T14:07:53.000Z",
      "title": "TIIL: Upcoming Board Meeting And Dividend Consideration Will Highlight Undervalued Earnings Power",
      "body": "Analysts have trimmed their price target on Technocraft Industries (India) from ₹3,770 to ₹3,650, citing updated assumptions that reflect different expectations for revenue growth, profit margins and future P/E levels. What's in the News A board meeting is scheduled for May 28, 2026, to review and approve the standalone and consolidated audited financial results for the quarter and year ended March 31, 2026.",
      "keyDevTypeId": null,
      "source_url": "https://simplywall.st/community/narratives/in/capital-goods/nse-tiil/technocraft-industries-india-shares/vkn0zu86-advanced-construction-techniques-and-automation-will-unlock-new-markets-g9nv/updates/11-analysts-have-trimmed-their-price-target-on-technocraft-indu",
