      "date": "2026-02-09T00:08:22.000Z",
      "title": "Investor sentiment improves as stock rises 19%",
      "body": "After last week's 19% share price gain to ₹2,324, the stock trades at a forward P/E ratio of 15x. Average forward P/E is 30x in the Machinery industry in India. Total returns to shareholders of 138% over the past three years.",
